      {
        "h_title": "Welcome to Khao Sok Tree House Resort",
        "main_title": "K haosok T ree H ouse",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Khao Sok Tree House",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Khao Sok Tree House, as our name says, offers jungle tree houses in Khao Sok Thailand. Your room or accommodation (tree house) can be as far up as 15m!",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Khao Sok Tree House is a nature theme styled resort with swimming pool, tree houses, Khao Sok jungle / Khao Sok - Cheow Lan - Lake tours and an excellent restaurant offering Thai and Western Food. There is a pool table, free wifi and big screen TV,",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "The rooms, bungalows, tree houses and accommodation in Khao Sok Tree House are all 'nature theme styled'.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "More than 15 different rooms bungalows and accommodation in the trees of Khao Sok in various sizes and prices. Khao Sok Tree House can also accommodate families up to 10 people in 1 room or accommodation !",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Update : Khao Sok Tree House offering new accommodation ! A new 'bamboo theme styled' tree house. Max. 10 people !",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Khao Sok Tours",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Explore Khao Sok National Park with Khao Sok Tree House. We offer various tours in Khao Sok National Park, Klong Phanom and Cheow Lan Lake.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Khao Sok and Cheow Lan Lake. A must visit location is Cheow Lan Lake. This man-made Lake and Dam became a wildlife sanctuary with stunning limestone scenery. Deeper on Cheow Lan Lake there is Klong Saeng Wildlife Sanctuary where you still can see the original wildlife of Thailand.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
